    "description": {
      "value": "This wide, hollow tube is two to three feet long and fires an unattached net at much greater range than one can be thrown.\n\nA net launcher can be wielded while propped up on your shoulder or cradled under your arm. A net must be carefully folded to be launched without tangling. Properly loading a net into a net launcher takes 1 minute. A net fired with a net launcher can target a Medium or smaller creature within 40 feet, rather than 20 feet."
